What does this program print?

```kotlin
fun size(n: Int) = when {
    n < 10 -> "S"
    n < 100 -> "M"
    else -> "L"
}

fun main() {
    println(listOf(5, 50, 500, 10).joinToString("") { size(it) })
}
```

