What does this program print?

```kotlin
fun sumUntilZero(xs: List<Int>): Int {
    var s = 0
    xs.forEach {
        if (it == 0) return s
        s += it
    }
    return -1
}

fun main() {
    println(sumUntilZero(listOf(3, 4, 0, 5)))
}
```
